 "elizeubarbosaabreu/leitor-de-gabaritos": {
  "http": 200,
  "stars": 0,
  "forks": 0,
  "license_key": "agpl-3.0",
  "license_name": "GNU Affero General Public License v3.0",
  "license_url": "https://gitlab.com/elizeubarbosaabreu/leitor-de-gabaritos/-/blob/master/LICENSE",
  "last_activity": "2026-09-23T21:32:34.080Z",
  "created": "2026-09-23T21:32:34.238Z",
  "topics": [],
  "desc": "Data for the main F-Droid repository at https://f-droid.orgEnglish  Leitor de Gabaritos uses computer vision (OMR) to read hand-filled answer sheets and grade exams automatically \u2014 no scanner or special filled-box marker needed. How it works: 1. Take a photo of the filled answer sheet or pick one from the gallery. 2. The app detects the bubble grid automatically. 3. Compare it with the official answer key and get the grade with correct, wrong and blank items.  Features: - Robust OMR reading from camera photos; - A-D (4 choices) and A-E (5 choices) sheets, up to 40 questions; - Automatic grading against the official answer key stored on the device; - Configurable exam score; - Question-by-question results; - Works fully offline.  Portugu\u00eas (pt-BR)  O Leitor de Gabaritos usa vis\u00e3o computacional (OMR) para ler folhas de respostas preenchidas \u00e0 m\u00e3o e corrigir provas automaticamente, sem scanner ou marcador de caixa. Como funciona: 1. Fotografe ou selecione da galeria o gabarito preenchido. 2. O app detecta a grade de bolhas automaticamente. 3. Compare com o gabarito oficial e veja a nota com acertos, erros e brancos.  Recursos: - Leitura OMR robusta com fotos da c\u00e2mera; - Gabaritos A-D (4 alternativas) e A-E (5 alternativas), at\u00e9 40 quest\u00f5es; - Corre\u00e7\u00e3o autom\u00e1tica contra o gabarito oficial salvo no aparelho; - Valor da prova configur\u00e1vel; - Resultado quest\u00e3o a quest\u00e3o; - Funciona offline. ",
  "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/elizeubarbosaabreu/leitor-de-gabaritos",
  "default_branch": "master",
  "readme_url": "https://gitlab.com/elizeubarbosaabreu/leitor-de-gabaritos/-/blob/master/README.md",
  "visibility": "public",
  "archived": null,
  "open_issues": null
